{
 "dur": 74.9,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.3,
   "chunks": [
    "Will AI bring about",
    "nuclear disaster?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 3.27,
   "chunks": [
    "This is Three Mile Island,",
    "home of America's",
    "worst nuclear accident.",
    "And you see, AI is",
    "bringing it back to life."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 10.26,
   "chunks": [
    "Microsoft signed",
    "a 20-year deal",
    "to restart Unit 1."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 13.88,
   "chunks": [
    "Why?",
    "Let's take it apart."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 15.52,
   "chunks": [
    "Uranium pellets",
    "in fuel rods split atoms.",
    "That makes heat."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 19.42,
   "chunks": [
    "Control rods",
    "soak up neutrons.",
    "Slide them in, it slows."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 23.16,
   "chunks": [
    "The pressure vessel keeps",
    "the water from boiling."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 25.88,
   "chunks": [
    "Hot water loops",
    "to the steam generator,",
    "and boils a second loop."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 29.82,
   "chunks": [
    "Steam spins the turbine,",
    "which spins the generator."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 33.19,
   "chunks": [
    "Cooling towers dump",
    "the leftover heat."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 35.67,
   "chunks": [
    "Heat, steam, spin, power.",
    "Then, GPUs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 38.51,
   "chunks": [
    "835 megawatts,",
    "24/7,",
    "carbon-free."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 42.52,
   "chunks": [
    "Why now?",
    "AI is hungry."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 44.43,
   "chunks": [
    "In 2023, data centers used",
    "4.4% of US power.",
    "2028?",
    "Up to 12."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v15",
   "t": 51.19,
   "chunks": [
    "Google and Amazon plan",
    "small modular reactors:",
    "Google's first by 2030,",
    "Amazon 5 gigawatts by 2039."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v16",
   "t": 59.02,
   "chunks": [
    "The catch?",
    "$1.6 billion to restart,",
    "years to build new ones,",
    "and waste with no permanent home."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v17",
   "t": 65.61,
   "chunks": [
    "Of course,",
    "AI won't cause a meltdown.",
    "But the future of AI",
    "might run on a plant from the past."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v18",
   "t": 71.53,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we",
    "take apart next?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}